<div class="eng"><div class="lab">GESHE MICHAEL'S ENGLISH (VERBATIM)</div>
<span class="u" data-d="1" data-l="s340S">One might <span class="u" data-d="3" data-l="s340f6">ask</span> <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s340w5">what</span> things serve as the <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s340w4">objects</span> <span class="u" data-d="6" data-l="s340p3">for</span> each of the <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s340w2">four</span> <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s340w1">divisions</span> of non-virtues just mentioned. The <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s340w9">object</span> of the non-virtues of the <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s340w8">first</span> <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s340w7">division</span> <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s340w11">consists of</span> <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s340w10">living beings</span>: <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s340w12">killing</span> <span class="u" data-d="6" data-l="s340p2">is</span> to <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s340w15">take the <span class="u" data-d="7" data-l="s340m16">life</span></span> <span class="u" data-d="6" data-l="s340p14">of</span> a <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s340w13">living being</span>; <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s340w17">malice</span> is to feel <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s340w20">hatred</span> <span class="u" data-d="6" data-l="s340p19">for</span> a <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s340w18">living being</span>; and--<span class="u" data-d="6" data-l="s340p27">as</span> the root text itself <span class="u" data-d="3" data-l="s340f26">says</span>--&quot;<span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s340w21"><span class="u" data-d="7" data-l="s340m23">harsh</span> <span class="u" data-d="7" data-l="s340m22">speech</span></span> <span class="u" data-d="6" data-l="s340p5">is</span> that which is <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s340w24"><span class="u" data-d="7" data-l="s340m25">un</span><span class="u" data-d="7" data-l="s340m6">pleasant</span></span>.&quot;</span>
